1.workflows / jobs
    parameters can be passed at job level and task level

    to pass at job level
    1. During creation of job in ui you can pass the job parameters

    to pass at task level
    1. use dbutils.jobs.taskValues.set("pname","pvalue")
    2. dbutils.notebook.exit()
    3. dbutils.widgets.set()

    to access
    1. dbutils.widgets.get()
    2.dbutils.jobs.taskValue.get("taskname","key")